<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116118" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκύ̆-μορος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quickly dying, dying
				early,</i> of Achilles, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.417
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.95
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				458
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκυμορώτατος ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.505
				</span></i>
			; of the suitors, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.266
			</span></i>, al.; of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιτρός</span> of
			Meleager, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.141
			</span></i>; in Epitaphs, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				527
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Beroea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				540
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thrace</span>), al.; so in later Prose,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.45
			</span></i>; of flowers, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				4
			</span></i>: of things, <i>transient,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				11.3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.478
			</span></i>: neut. pl. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				6.501
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Isaura</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>bringing a quick</i> or <i>early death,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.441
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμάκων δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώνειον -ώτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dio</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			.</div>
